What is the output?

String s = "hello";
System.out.println(s.length() + s.charAt(1));

What is the output?

String a = new String("java");
String b = new String("java");
System.out.println((a == b) + " " + a.equals(b));

What is the output?

for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) {
  if (i == 2) continue;
  if (i == 4) break;
  System.out.print(i);
}

What is the output?

class A { void show() { System.out.print("A"); } }
class B extends A { void show() { System.out.print("B"); } }
// ...
A obj = new B();
obj.show();

What is the output?

try { int x = 5 / 0; }
catch (ArithmeticException e) { System.out.print("A"); }
finally { System.out.print("F"); }
